/ On a phone, each segment is as wide as its label plus an equal share of the
  free width, so the gaps between the labels are equal. Equal segments either
  cut a long label like "Overall" short or leave its neighbor off center.
nav.relative.w-full.grid.grid-flow-col.lg:landscape:flex.items-stretch.lg:landscape:justify-start.lg:landscape:p-0.font-medium.lg:landscape:uppercase.sm:landscape:text-sm.md:landscape:text-base.md:landscape:tracking-wider.lg:landscape:gap-0.lg:landscape:space-x-4[
  aria-label="Tabs"
  class='gap-0.5 p-0.5 text-sm'
  data=Ui::OptimisticNav.data(slide: true)
]
  - items.each do |item|
    = item
